# Chapter: on-device ride replay.
#
# Settings > Logging > Ride logs, then one ride opened and worked through: seeking, playing at
# different rates, zooming around the cursor, choosing what the charts show, and the summary.
# The ride is the host fixture's 47 minute synthetic ride, read through the production replay
# parser exactly as a card's file would be.
#
# Chart positions: the plot runs from x 28 (start of the ride) to about x 315 (the end), roughly
# 10 s per pixel, so x 146 is 19:30, where the ride dips into regeneration.
title "Ride replay"
subtitle "Every logged ride, charted on the display."

logging on
demo 1
boot dashboard
caption-min 750

caption "Ride logging" "Recorded to the microSD card."
wait 1600
tap 160 120 settle=700
tap-label "SETTINGS" settle=700
tap-label "LOGGING" settle=1800

caption "Your rides" "Pick any ride on the card."
tap-label "RIDE LOGS" settle=2200

caption "Replay" "Tap or drag to seek."
tap-label "RIDE 12" settle=1400
drag 40 120 146 120 1000 settle=1600
drag 146 120 232 120 800 settle=900

caption "Play" "1x up to 100x."
tap 159 220 settle=2000
tap 296 21 settle=350
tap 296 21 settle=350
tap 296 21 settle=1800
tap 296 21 settle=350
tap 296 21 settle=1800
tap 159 220 settle=600

# Back to the regen dip, then zoom in on it: the moment under the cursor keeps its place.
caption "Zoom" "Each step halves the span."
tap 146 120 settle=900
tap 300 220 settle=700
tap 300 220 settle=700
tap 300 220 settle=1400
drag 146 120 178 120 700 settle=1200
tap 18 220 settle=550
tap 18 220 settle=550
tap 18 220 settle=900

caption "Up to four charts" "Choose what each shows."
tap 248 21 settle=1000
tap-label "4" settle=800
tap-label "Current" settle=800
tap-label "Phase amps" settle=800
tap-label "DONE" settle=900
drag 232 120 146 120 900 settle=1800

caption "Ride summary" "Distance, speeds, energy, peaks."
tap 155 21 settle=3200
tap-label "DONE" settle=600
tap-label "BACK" settle=1200
